1
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:10,159
Hurry up and take your medicine.

2
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,799
Honey, not right now.

3
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,959
Just leave it there. Put it down.

4
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,120
What's wrong, honey?

5
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,120
Honey...

6
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:26,640
There's something I need to tell you.

7
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,040
Go ahead.

8
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:34,959
At the class reunion three years ago,

9
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,840
I ran into Wang Tao.

10
00:01:40,319 --> 00:01:41,920
My high school Class Monitor.

11
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:46,239
I don't really remember him.

12
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:47,680
By the way,

13
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,799
I booked you a specialist appointment.

14
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:50,799
It's at two this afternoon.

15
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,000
We still have some time.

16
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,079
Get some rest while you can.

17
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:55,280
Honey...

18
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:57,599
I have to tell you today.

19
00:01:59,040 --> 00:01:59,840
What is it?

20
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,360
My illness...

21
00:02:12,159 --> 00:02:13,960
he gave it to me.

22
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,919
We both drank too much that day.

23
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,120
Come on, let's toast our Class Monitor!

24
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,919
Toasting me already?

25
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,599
Come on, everyone's having fun!

26
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,639
Drink up!

27
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:35,479
Drink up, let's drink till we drop!

28
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:36,280
All right!

29
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:40,639
Keep drinking, don't stop!

30
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,360
Weizi, no more, stop pouring.

31
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,599
Let's drink this one.

32
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,919
Let me propose a toast.

33
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:48,280
Let's toast our old dean of students.

34
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,439
If it weren't for him

35
00:02:50,439 --> 00:02:51,879
sending us to the office every day,

36
00:02:51,879 --> 00:02:54,080
and me going to smooth things over,

37
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,960
we wouldn't have this solid bond, right?

38
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:59,199
He laid a great foundation for us.

39
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:01,199
Come on, toast him with this.

40
00:03:01,599 --> 00:03:03,319
Come on, cheers.

41
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,199
Come on, Du Lan.

42
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:06,960
Bottoms up.

43
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:08,719
Time flies,

44
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,759
long live our friendship!

45
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:12,080
Cheers! Cheers!

46
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:16,840
Great liquor!

47
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,240
Come on, come on.

48
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:17,680
Sit down, sit down.

49
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,159
Eat up, eat up.

50
00:03:18,159 --> 00:03:18,800
Keep eating.

51
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,159
Haijun,

52
00:03:20,479 --> 00:03:21,360
since you got back from the military,

53
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,039
we haven't seen each other in years.

54
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,000
We used to play basketball together.

55
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:04,919
No, no, no.

56
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,919
You can't do that.

57
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,400
That's not right, that's not right.

58
00:04:10,159 --> 00:04:11,960
That is just wrong.

59
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:14,360
What's wrong with it?

60
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,240
I was away all year round,

61
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:22,839
barely ever came home,

62
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,959
and she hooked up with Wang Tao.

63
00:04:29,879 --> 00:04:31,480
They carried on for three whole years,

64
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,319
and I had no clue.

65
00:04:37,399 --> 00:04:39,360
I can imagine

66
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,920
how furious you were.

67
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,120
Of course I was furious.

68
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,879
Wang Tao has a wife and kid,

69
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:48,839
yet he still pulled something like that.

70
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:53,759
What happened next?

71
00:04:57,839 --> 00:04:58,360
After that...

72
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,279
You're here.

73
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,600
Go order whatever you want to drink.

74
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,160
Du Lan.

75
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:22,000
We shouldn't see each other anymore.

76
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:26,720
After work yesterday,

77
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:29,360
I went to pick up my daughter from school.

78
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:33,439
Watching her

79
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:35,959
run over like a little bunny, calling out,

80
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:36,839
"Daddy,"

81
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,160
at that moment, I suddenly realized

82
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:45,079
that I was about to lose everything.

83
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:47,000
My wife isn't the best cook,

84
00:05:48,879 --> 00:05:51,319
but she remembers I like salty food.

85
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,839
And she never asks where I'm going,

86
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:57,560
who I'm with,

87
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,519
or what time I'll be home.

88
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:01,319
Maybe it's trust,

89
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:06,120
or maybe she's just resigned to it.

90
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,720
That's why I...

91
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:14,120
What, are you having second thoughts?

92
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,439
I don't want to lose my family.

93
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,639
Don't you have a family, too?

94
00:06:25,319 --> 00:06:26,319
If we both go back now,

95
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:27,519
it's not too late.

96
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,079
Take care.

97
00:07:19,199 --> 00:07:20,360
It's tuberculosis.

98
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,480
It's currently contagious.

99
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,360
Have you had close contact with anyone recently?

100
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,399
That's just how it is.

101
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,959
I'm the one who let you down.

102
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:56,040
He's definitely the one who infected you.

103
00:07:57,639 --> 00:07:58,920
Does he know you're sick?

104
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:05,160
Since

105
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:08,759
he used you to vent his frustration,

106
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:12,439
dumped you once he got bored,

107
00:08:14,279 --> 00:08:15,639
and infected you with this disease,

108
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,240
100,000.

109
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,680
Not a single penny less.

110
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:31,600
Go demand it from him.

111
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,960
I'll go demand it from him.

112
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,000
Right.

113
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:45,639
We have to get justice.

114
00:08:58,399 --> 00:08:59,360
What are you doing here?

115
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,919
Why are you yelling?

116
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,159
Don't yell at me!

117
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,039
You've been dodging me,

118
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:05,120
ignoring my texts.

119
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,440
You have to pay what you owe.

120
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:08,159
What do I owe?

121
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:10,720
What the hell do I owe you?

122
00:09:11,279 --> 00:09:12,240
Have you lost your mind?

123
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,480
I'm picking up my kid from school!

124
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,480
Why did you come here?

125
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:15,919
I got tested.

126
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,679
It's tuberculosis.

127
00:09:18,279 --> 00:09:19,000
You gave it to me.

128
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,000
I gave it to you?

129
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:21,559
Tuberculosis?

130
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,320
Stop talking nonsense, will you?

131
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,480
I just had a checkup.

132
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:26,960
I'm completely healthy from head to toe!

133
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,080
I don't have that disease!

134
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,600
Don't pretend you didn't hit on me first!

135
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:32,600
I threw away everything for you!

136
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:34,679
You expect to just go back to your family?

137
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,399
What about me?

138
00:09:36,919 --> 00:09:37,799
What am I supposed to do?

139
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,600
What about you?

140
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,840
Do whatever the hell you want!

141
00:09:40,799 --> 00:09:41,320
I hit on you,

142
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,320
and you went along with it!

143
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,799
It takes two to tango!

144
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:44,799
Du Lan.

145
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:46,759
Listen to me.

146
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:48,600
I've already made it very clear to you.

147
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:50,440
We're done.

148
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,000
You and I are completely over.

149
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:52,879
If you have any shame left,

150
00:09:52,879 --> 00:09:53,879
stop coming after me!

151
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:55,960
Stop right there!

152
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:58,799
I just want 100,000.

153
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,200
It's not much.

154
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,000
Not a penny less!

155
00:10:04,399 --> 00:10:06,399
Don't laugh! Fine if you won't pay.

156
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,559
I'll tell your wife and kid.

157
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:10,480
I'll tell your whole family what you did!

158
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,000
Fine.

159
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,159
Go ahead.

160
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:13,679
Go tell them right now!

161
00:10:13,679 --> 00:10:14,519
You think I won't?

162
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,759
I wronged my wife,

163
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,279
but I refuse to let you threaten me!

164
00:10:18,799 --> 00:10:19,799
Now get the hell away from me!

165
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:22,080
Are you even human?

166
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:36,879
What do we do?

167
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:40,799
I'll go find him.

168
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:47,600
This car is a great deal.

169
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,559
Look, the mileage is very low,

170
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:50,720
and it's really cheap.

171
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,000
Just over 140,000.

172
00:10:52,919 --> 00:10:54,919
You can sit inside and get a feel for it.

173
00:10:57,679 --> 00:10:58,679
Can I take it for a test drive?

174
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,399
One moment, sir.

175
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,720
Just a moment.

176
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,879
Take your time browsing, sir.

177
00:11:04,879 --> 00:11:06,080
I have a customer here.

178
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:08,279
A test drive is no problem.

179
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:09,960
Which car would you like to test-drive?

180
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,399
Let's do this one.

181
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:13,559
Th- Sure, absolutely!

182
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:14,799
Do you have your driver's license?

183
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,120
A seasoned driver.

184
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,000
After you.

185
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,320
Let me register you first.

186
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:27,759
You've got great taste, sir.

187
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,799
The minute you walked in, you picked

188
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:31,679
the best car in our store.

189
00:11:32,279 --> 00:11:34,159
The discounts are fantastic right now too.

190
00:11:34,399 --> 00:11:36,120
If you can put down a deposit soon,

191
00:11:36,159 --> 00:11:38,200
I'll talk to my boss,

192
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,279
and get you a lower price.

193
00:11:40,279 --> 00:11:41,000
Thanks.

194
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,000
It's mostly that at home,

195
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:45,679
someone's in poor health.

196
00:11:46,399 --> 00:11:47,960
I want to get something comfortable.

197
00:11:48,919 --> 00:11:51,399
Is that an elderly parent or a child?

198
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,279
My wife.

199
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,600
My wife is sick.

200
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,320
I can tell.

201
00:11:58,039 --> 00:11:59,360
You're such a caring husband, sir.

202
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,159
Who doesn't care for their wife?

203
00:12:03,879 --> 00:12:05,120
You must have kids?

204
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:05,679
Yes.

205
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:06,519
Two.

206
00:12:06,519 --> 00:12:07,320
A boy and a girl.

207
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,360
And you?

208
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,919
My wife is an artist.

209
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:15,000
To keep her figure,

210
00:12:16,159 --> 00:12:17,480
we decided not to have any.

211
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:20,919
You really pamper your wife.

212
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:23,320
Sir,

213
00:12:23,559 --> 00:12:24,879
what do you think of this car?

214
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,960
How does it feel to drive?

215
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:29,799
Not bad.

216
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,000
Slow down a bit, slow down.

217
00:12:32,279 --> 00:12:33,120
Please slow down.

218
00:12:36,279 --> 00:12:38,159
What illness does your wife have?

219
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:42,039
Sepsis caused by tuberculosis.

220
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,240
It's late-stage.

221
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,320
I haven't told her.

222
00:12:50,639 --> 00:12:52,399
I'm just a long-haul truck driver.

223
00:12:53,679 --> 00:12:54,559
Once I leave,

224
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,799
I'm gone for over half a month.

225
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,799
My wife went to a class reunion.

226
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,919
Everyone says class reunions

227
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:05,840
are an Affair club.

228
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:11,120
Crazy as it sounds,

229
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,759
my wife really did hook up

230
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:15,919
with her Class Monitor.

231
00:13:16,559 --> 00:13:18,000
It went on for three whole years.

232
00:13:19,879 --> 00:13:21,240
In the end, her Class Monitor

233
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,200
broke it off just like that,

234
00:13:25,399 --> 00:13:27,200
and left my wife riddled with disease.

235
00:13:27,879 --> 00:13:29,039
It cost a fortune.

236
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,000
Tell me,

237
00:13:34,519 --> 00:13:35,399
this money...

238
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,759
shouldn't I make that man pay for it?

239
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:47,759
You've got a son and a daughter,

240
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,759
and a happy family.

241
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,000
What about mine?

242
00:13:58,159 --> 00:14:00,799
My wife's on an IV at the hospital daily.

243
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,360
What's your point?

244
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:07,279
My point?

245
00:14:07,279 --> 00:14:09,080
She already made it crystal clear to you.

246
00:14:10,039 --> 00:14:11,039
We can let this go,

247
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:15,559
but not without a proper resolution.

248
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,200
We want 100,000.

249
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:21,480
That's not much at all.

250
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:23,919
My wife doesn't have long.

251
00:14:29,679 --> 00:14:31,559
Before she goes,

252
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,679
I want her to eat well,

253
00:14:37,559 --> 00:14:38,879
take her on a trip,

254
00:14:44,279 --> 00:14:45,879
and let her pass away in peace.

255
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,519
So,

256
00:14:55,039 --> 00:14:56,000
100,000.

257
00:14:57,759 --> 00:14:58,960
Not a single cent less.

258
00:15:01,799 --> 00:15:02,840
Don't push me.

259
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,080
Where you live,

260
00:15:06,919 --> 00:15:08,279
where your kids go to school...

261
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,279
I know it all.

262
00:15:12,919 --> 00:15:14,480
Are you threatening me?

263
00:15:16,279 --> 00:15:16,840
Yes.

264
00:15:17,399 --> 00:15:19,159
We were in the wrong here.

265
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:21,399
I've already confessed to my wife.

266
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:24,200
We truly cherish our hard-won life.

267
00:15:25,639 --> 00:15:26,879
You say Du Lan is sick,

268
00:15:27,159 --> 00:15:28,440
and I feel terrible about that.

269
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:31,320
But I really didn't give her this illness.

270
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,600
Do I look like a sick man to you?

271
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,399
If you don't believe me,

272
00:15:34,399 --> 00:15:35,440
we can drive to the hospital right now

273
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,960
and get me tested. That'll settle it.

274
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,000
Even sleeping with a hooker costs money.

275
00:15:47,919 --> 00:15:48,600
Three years!

276
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:49,679
Do the math!

277
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,279
How much would three years cost?

278
00:15:51,759 --> 00:15:52,759
You do the math for me!

279
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:56,080
Trying to play tough with me, huh?

280
00:15:58,159 --> 00:15:58,720
Fine!

281
00:15:59,159 --> 00:16:00,759
Let's call the police right now, then.

282
00:16:01,519 --> 00:16:03,000
However the law wants to punish me,

283
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,240
I'll take it willingly.

284
00:16:09,039 --> 00:16:10,360
Don't push me!

285
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:13,679
100,000 yuan!

286
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,080
Not a single cent less.

287
00:16:19,279 --> 00:16:21,120
Otherwise, nobody gets to live in peace!

288
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:32,759
He was going to call the police.

289
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,240
If things really blew up,

290
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,159
the Cultural Bureau,

291
00:16:40,799 --> 00:16:41,960
my family,

292
00:16:42,159 --> 00:16:42,879
the neighbors,

293
00:16:43,679 --> 00:16:45,120
they'd all find out.

294
00:16:46,279 --> 00:16:47,840
What disease I had,

295
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:50,000
who I'd been with...

296
00:16:52,279 --> 00:16:54,600
I wouldn't even die clean.

297
00:17:01,559 --> 00:17:02,440
Die clean?

298
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,559
He ruined me like this,

299
00:17:07,079 --> 00:17:08,839
yet he acts like nothing happened.

300
00:17:12,079 --> 00:17:13,440
He made the mistake,

301
00:17:14,319 --> 00:17:15,680
yet I can't go on living.

302
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:20,599
His family is intact—

303
00:17:21,559 --> 00:17:22,799
wife and kid,

304
00:17:23,519 --> 00:17:24,920
a happy life.

305
00:17:27,039 --> 00:17:28,079
How is that fair?

306
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:30,839
How is that fair?!

307
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:40,480
My condition...

308
00:17:42,359 --> 00:17:44,000
Did you know all along?

309
00:17:49,799 --> 00:17:50,880
I looked it up.

310
00:17:52,359 --> 00:17:53,599
Tuberculous sepsis.

311
00:17:55,759 --> 00:17:58,440
The bacteria spread via the bloodstream,

312
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:01,119
rapidly destroying multiple organs.

313
00:18:01,759 --> 00:18:03,000
It progresses fast,

314
00:18:04,519 --> 00:18:05,799
with a high mortality rate.
